Step 1 - Find every occurrence-->

Run this from the project root:

grep -RIn \
  --exclude-dir=.git \
  --exclude-dir=node_modules \
  --exclude-dir=venv \
  --exclude-dir=__pycache__ \
  --exclude='*.sql.gz' \
  "Cubicles Services" .

This will show something like:

frontend/src/components/layout/Header.tsx:28: Cubicles Services
backend/app/main.py:14: Cubicles Services API
README.md:1: Cubicles Services
...

Review the output first.

Step 2 - Replace everywhere -->

After you're satisfied, run:

find . \
  -type f \
  ! -path "./.git/*" \
  ! -path "./frontend/node_modules/*" \
  ! -path "./backend/venv/*" \
  ! -path "./database/*.sql.gz" \
  -exec sed -i 's/Cubicles Services/Cubicles Place/g' {} +

That's it.

